Design a 4-bit counter that increments its output, `producer_data`, on every rising edge of the clock signal, `producer_iclk`. The counter initializes to zero and toggles the clock every 5 time units, effectively generating a periodic clock signal to trigger the counting operation. The output increments from 0 to 15, rolling over back to 0 after reaching its maximum value.
