description:
Design a one-bit full adder using dataflow modeling. The adder takes three inputs: two bits (a and b) and a carry-in (cin). It computes the sum (s) as the exclusive OR of the inputs and produces a carry-out (cout) based on the logical OR of the AND combinations of the inputs. The module includes a time delay of 1 time unit for both the sum and carry-out outputs, simulating propagation delay in the circuit.
module top_module(
    input a,b,cin,
    output s,cout
    );

