Design a simple 2-input AND gate circuit. The module takes two one-bit inputs, A and B, and produces a one-bit output X, which is the logical AND of the inputs. When both A and B are high (1), the output X will be high; otherwise, it will be low (0).
module top_module(
    input A,
    input B,
    output X
);

