description:
Design a tri-state input buffer with optional disable functionality. The module routes the input signal I to the output O unless the IBUFDISABLE signal is asserted. If IBUFDISABLE is high, the output O is driven by a specific condition based on the SIM_DEVICE parameter, while it defaults to the input I when IBUFDISABLE is low. This functionality is intended for use with low-power conditions, evident from the IBUF_LOW_PWR parameter.
