description:
Design a pipelined 2-to-4 decoder. When enabled, this module receives a 2-bit input and, after two clock cycles, activates one of the four output lines corresponding to the binary value of the input. Specifically, it outputs a single high signal on one of the four outputs (0 to 3) based on the input, allowing for efficient signal decoding in sequential logic applications. The use of stages in the decoding process enhances the timing and synchronization of output signals.
