description:
Design a 4-to-2 binary decoder. The module takes a 4-bit input and produces a 2-bit output based on the binary value of the input. Specifically, it maps the inputs 0000, 0001, and 0010 to the outputs 00, 01, and 10 respectively, while any other input defaults to output 00.
module top_module(
    input [3:0] in,
    output reg [1:0] out
);

code:
module top_module(
    input [3:0] in,
    output reg [1:0] out
);always @(*) begin
        case (in)
            4'b0000: out = 2'b00;
            4'b0001: out = 2'b01;
            4'b0010: out = 2'b10;
            default: out = 2'b00;
        endcase
    end

endmodule

